From caf-talk Caf Apr 28 11:34:26 1994
From: morgan@engr.uky.edu (Wes Morgan)
Newsgroups: alt.comp.acad-freedom.talk,comp.admin.policy
Subject: Re: [comp.admin.policy]  AUP Review - UMass
