   Academic freedom requires that we distinguish the "Social AUP" from
   the "Legal AUP.
     * Social AUP
          + Material is legal
          + Offends you
          + Not enforced with official sanctions
          + Enforced socially
               o informal criticism
               o refutations
               o leaving
               o shunning
               o etc.
     * Legal AUP
          + Material is not legal
          + Defined with clear, formal rules
          + Enforced by authorities with due process
            
